## 2026.11.17  Version 3.0.0

- [x] Accessibility: WCAG AA colour palette, labelled social links, one `<h1>` per page, valid `<time>` values, underlined links in content
- [x] Performance: stylesheet inlined (moved to `assets/css`), sized avatar via `params.avatar` / `params.avatar2x`, lazy-loaded images with intrinsic dimensions
- [x] Automatic dark mode (`prefers-color-scheme`)
- [x] Class-based syntax highlighting with an accessible palette; requires `markup.highlight.noClasses: false`
- [x] Footer links read from `params.social`; new `params.favicon`
- [x] Tables scroll inside the text column instead of breaking words
- [x] Requires Hugo 0.158.0+: `locale`, `pagination.pagerSize`, `services.*` config keys, embedded partials; KaTeX 0.19.1

## 2021.08.21  Version 2.2.0

- [x] Support multiple languages

## 2021.08.17  Version 2.1.0

- [x] Adding ability to disable disqus comments on a single post

## 2021.03.01  Version 2.0.0

- [x] Refactor
- [x] Support hugo 0.80.0


## 2017.12.09  Version 1.0.0

- [x] Support twitter card.
- [x] Remove name in `.Site.Params`. It's duplicate with `.Site.title`.
- [x] Add `author` in `.Site.Params`.
